{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play better without leaving the game.</strong> Sidekick AI is a voice-first, 3D companion that understands your screen context and speaks concise, actionable tips. Get just-in-time coaching, share your best moments, and review a clean daily recap.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why it\u2019s different</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice first:</strong> voice in and voice out, like a real conversation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-overlay tips:</strong> answers right where you are\u2014no browser detours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D avatar with emotions/gestures:</strong> feels like a supportive teammate, not a chatbot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights + recap built in:</strong> your clutch plays auto-clip with smart captions and one-tap share.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Safety first:</strong> dual moderation; stream-safe defaults.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time tips:</strong> concise voice guidance during boss phases, PvP rounds, and clutch moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992240/extras/49243f8dc74ea14127bcb106aa8072ba.avif?t=1767062235\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game awareness:</strong> Steam Rich Presence + lightweight vision to understand scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992240/extras/e00de56048c52c2141f09079b1d5d54f.avif?t=1767062235\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-highlights:</